BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    The next season, the river's flow diminished. Only one seed arrived at her shore. She wonder) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ed: had the waters changed, or did mists cloud her vision? The Oracle whispered, "Communic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ation between rivers is imperfect. What you see may not be what was sent.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
