BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    She chose balance-returning enough to sustain the cycle, neither hoarding nor giving blindly) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      . The River of Return flowed steadily, matching effort with effort.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    The Oracle nodded: "Wisdom lies not in rigid rules, but in reading the waters. Match trust w) Tj ET
