BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a misty chasm. The gods built a sacred b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        ridge between them with a mysterious power: any gift carried across would triple in weig) Tj ET
