BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ther reciprocates with honor, both villages prosper beyond what either could achieve alo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        ne.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
