BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      Myth: In the time before memory, the Twin Rivers flowed with changing tides. Some seasons ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        brought abundance to the River of Giving; others brought drought. Yet the cycle persiste) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        d.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      A young keeper arrived at the rivers with five seeds. The first season, she planted three ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        seeds generously in the River of Giving. They multiplied to nine, and the River of Retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        n carried back a fair portion, honoring her trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The next season, the river's flow diminished. Only one seed arrived at her shore. She wond) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        ered: had the waters changed, or did mists cloud her vision? The Oracle whispered, "Comm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        unication between rivers is imperfect. What you see may not be what was sent.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      Still, the keeper planted this single seed. It tripled as before. Now she faced her test: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        should she return by the same measure she received, or remember the fuller trust of earl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ier seasons?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      She chose balance-returning enough to sustain the cycle, neither hoarding nor giving blind) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        ly. The River of Return flowed steadily, matching effort with effort.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      The Oracle nodded: "Wisdom lies not in rigid rules, but in reading the waters. Match trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (         with trust, shortage with understanding, abundance with generosity. The rivers teach ad) Tj ET
