BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      In ancient times, two rivers flowed through a barren valley-the River of Giving and the Ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        ver of Return. Neither could reach the sea alone, for the land was too dry and swallowed) Tj ET
