BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      A wanderer arrived carrying five seeds. The Oracle told him: "Plant what you will in the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        iver of Giving. Its magic waters will triple whatever grows there, but only the River of) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (         Return can carry the harvest back to you.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      The wanderer hesitated. If he planted nothing, he'd keep his five seeds but gain nothing m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ore. If he planted all five, he'd risk everything on the River of Return's generosity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Wisely, he planted three seeds. The River of Giving's waters worked their magic, and nine ) Tj ET
