BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      Both rivers swelled with this exchange. The wanderer prospered. The valley bloomed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
