BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      A young keeper arrived at the rivers with five seeds. The first season, she planted three ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        seeds generously in the River of Giving. They multiplied to nine, and the River of Retur) Tj ET
