BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      The next season, the river's flow diminished. Only one seed arrived at her shore. She wond) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        ered: had the waters changed, or did mists cloud her vision? The Oracle whispered, "Comm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        unication between rivers is imperfect. What you see may not be what was sent.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      Still, the keeper planted this single seed. It tripled as before. Now she faced her test: ) Tj ET
