BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      She chose balance-returning enough to sustain the cycle, neither hoarding nor giving blind) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        ly. The River of Return flowed steadily, matching effort with effort.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      The Oracle nodded: "Wisdom lies not in rigid rules, but in reading the waters. Match trust) Tj ET
