BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      But the daughter remembered her mother's final teaching: "The bridge connects two separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        d villages. Sometimes mists obscure the path. Sometimes storms prevent crossing. Sometim) Tj ET
