BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    The keeper approached the rivers for the fourth season, carrying lessons from all that came ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      before. The first season taught bold trust. The second taught fair return even with little) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      . The third taught balanced wisdom.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    Now the fourth season brought unexpected silence-no seeds arrived across the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    She sat by the riverbank, contemplating. The young keeper might conclude: "The covenant is b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      roken. I should hoard all future seeds." But she had learned deeper truths.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    She understood: rivers flow through many seasons. Sometimes droughts come. Sometimes the oth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      er keeper plants their own fields. Sometimes mists confuse the count, making abundance app) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ear as nothing, or nothing appear as abundance. A single empty season reveals circumstance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      s, not character.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    The Oracle appeared: "What will you do when the fifth season comes?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    The keeper replied: "I will remember all four seasons, not just the last. Three seasons show) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ed willingness to engage-sending seeds, returning fairly. One silence does not erase three) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (       participations. When seeds come again, I will respond with the wisdom I've gathered: neit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      her blind trust nor bitter withdrawal, but measured engagement.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    "And if seeds never come again?" asked the Oracle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    "Then I will still have preserved my own character," the keeper answered. "The covenant live) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      s in those who honor it, regardless of what others choose.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    The rivers continued flowing, carrying possibilities.) Tj ET
