BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    Myth: The Daughter's First Crossing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    After the season of empty crossings, the daughter stood at the bridge with grain in her bask) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      et. The village watched: would she cross, or would silence breed silence?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    She remembered her mother's wisdom differently now. Her mother had always received; she had ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      perfected the art of return. But the daughter faced the sender's test-to initiate after di) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      sappointment, to trust after uncertainty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    "The bridge requires two dancers," she said. "If both wait forever for the other to begin, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      he magic dies.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    She took neither the path of reckless abundance nor fearful withholding. She carried three m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      easures across-enough to demonstrate commitment, to show the bridge still stood open, yet ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      mindful that patterns remain unclear. Was the silence temporary hardship, lasting change, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      or merely those persistent mists?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    The bridge's magic worked. Three became nine. Now the other village would choose their respo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      nse, and she would learn something true about the covenant's strength.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    The elders recorded her decision: "After empty crossings come testing crossings. Send enough) Tj ET
