BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      The daughter stood at the bridge in the fifth season, her heart cautious but hopeful. She ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        carried two measures-not the abundance of earlier seasons, nor the withdrawal of fear, b) Tj ET
