BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (         the signal she had hoped for: "We too believe in the bridge.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      The elder smiled: "You see now? Through the thickest mists, when both villages moved caref) Tj ET
