BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        roportional fairness. Neither demanded perfect vision before acting with honor.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      The daughter understood: "The mists taught us something the clear days never could. When w) Tj ET
