BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      "Exactly," the elder replied. "Now the path is clearer. Keep dancing this careful dance. S) Tj ET
