BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      The keeper read the distant village's tale of "mists beginning to clear" and "generous ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        urns." Yet she stood in her own truth: the sixth season had brought her nothing. Empty s) Tj ET
