BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      Perhaps their story was real in their telling. Perhaps mists truly distorted what each vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        lage saw. Or perhaps they wrote of different seasons, different bridges. The keeper coul) Tj ET
