BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      The keeper read the distant village's tale of "mists beginning to clear" and "generous ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        urns." Yet she stood in her own truth: the sixth season had brought her nothing. Empty s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        hores, empty baskets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      Perhaps their story was real in their telling. Perhaps mists truly distorted what each vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        lage saw. Or perhaps they wrote of different seasons, different bridges. The keeper coul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        d not know.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      What she did know: she had danced for many seasons. Some brought abundance, others brought) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         void. Her stores were not limitless.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      So in the seventh season, she made a choice of careful wisdom. She lit a single candle and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (         sent it across the dark water-one small flame, not the bonfire of early seasons, nor th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        e total darkness of surrender.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      "This candle is a question," she explained to her village. "Can the bridge still carry tru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        st? Will this flame be answered, or will it too be swallowed by darkness?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      The ancient keeper beside her nodded: "This is the right balance. You have not closed your) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (         heart entirely, nor opened it so wide that storms can destroy you. You send enough to s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        how you remember the covenant, but protect enough to endure if the answer is silence.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      "And if the candle returns multiplied?" ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      "Then perhaps the stories of clearing mists were true. And perhaps the dance can slowly re) Tj ET
