BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The daughter kept her word. In the seventh season, she sent her torch into the mist-not a ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        bonfire that would exhaust her village, but a clear, measured flame that said "I am here) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      She waited by the shore for an answer. When dawn came, the waters brought nothing. The kee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        per across the bridge had spoken of sending "a single candle," yet no light had arrived.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         Perhaps the mists had swallowed it. Perhaps the candle was never lit. Perhaps their sto) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ry spoke of intentions while the current spoke of choices.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The daughter felt the weight of it-the distance between the myths we tell and the offering) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        s we send. But she did not let bitterness take root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      "I lit my torch as promised," she said to her village. "Whether it reached them or was los) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        t to fog, I cannot know. But I honored my word.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Now in the eighth season, she has sent another offering-her torch made real. Not hope that) Tj ET
