BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Myth: The Torch Sent, The Response Awaited) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      The daughter kept her word. In the seventh season, she sent her torch into the mist-not a ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        bonfire that would exhaust her village, but a clear, measured flame that said "I am here) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      She waited by the shore for an answer. When dawn came, the waters brought nothing. The kee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        per across the bridge had spoken of sending "a single candle," yet no light had arrived.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (         Perhaps the mists had swallowed it. Perhaps the candle was never lit. Perhaps their sto) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        ry spoke of intentions while the current spoke of choices.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      The daughter felt the weight of it-the distance between the myths we tell and the offering) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        s we send. But she did not let bitterness take root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      "I lit my torch as promised," she said to her village. "Whether it reached them or was los) Tj ET
